# Korriban, Darth Sion and the way out (TSL, 702KOR, 701KOR, to 003EBO):
# back from the detention room, Sion in the central chamber with two Sith Assassins (asked how he
# knows Kreia, what she wants with the Exile and what he wants with her,
# told he will not harm her: no "don't let me stand in your way"), fought
# until Kreia's voice: he cannot be defeated, flee (thanked, no -INF); the
# Exile flees to the valley, Sion sending his assassins after a male Exile
# ("She protects him. Shields him."); back aboard the Ebon Hawk, T3-M4's
# message from Kelborn (thanked, +INF), Dxun next.
# Starts from the detention room, the front door open:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @korriban_vash data/routes/tsl/korriban_sion.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "The Sith Academy" (its end), Kerbow's "Darth
# Sion" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Darth Sion (DarthSion) keeps one hit point (Min1HP); his user-defined
#   script (k_sion_ud) starts Kreia's call (kreia_si) once he is wounded,
#   and her scene's end the flight (sion start 2, a_to_701kor): the fight
#   ends with the module, as `fight` ends on leaving it.
say How do you know Kreia? # sion start 1 (male): his questions
say What does Kreia want with me?
say What do you want with her?
say I will not let you harm her. # (not "If you want revenge on her, don't let me stand in your way")
to tr_sion_fight     # the central chamber: Sion and his assassins
talk
say Thanks for the information. # kreia_si: flee (not "Now you tell me", nor "I won't run")
fight 40             # the two Sith Assassins, then Sion to Kreia's call, and the flight
module 701kor        # (sion start 2: Sion orders the hunt; a_to_701kor)
fight 30             # any of Sion's hunters about the valley (a_sion_end)
to to_ebonhawk_custom # aboard (tr_ehawk_custom: 003EBO_RETURN_DEST, StartNewModule)
module 003ebo
say Thanks T3. Please tell me what Kelborn said. # t3kelbrn (+INF): Kavar's message,
talk                 # back to Dxun (Vash makes the fourth Jedi found)
save korriban_done
